  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"通过接口可以获取到一级行业、二级行业、三级行业列表，其中代理商创建客户时使用的是二级行业，而在创建创意填写创意分类时使用的是三级行业，请注意区分。配合接口有【获取Access-Token】和【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"ad.tools.industry.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/industry/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1697640099656704\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求时需要授权access-token，获取方法见此接口文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"ad.return_code.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"应答中的返回码和返回信息详见此接口文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1697640099656704\",\"title\":\"获取行业列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-I8H1Jgkc\">获取行业列表，通过接口可以获取到一级行业、二级行业、三级行业列表，其中代理商创建客户时使用的是二级行业，而在创建创意填写创意分类时使用的是三级行业，请注意区分。</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201772632891123725%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-2c001hH7\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h5><p data-id=\"p838747a-87g0Ftqq\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/industry/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/industry/get/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1697640099656704\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-RQE18bcc\" id=\"link-1\">请求方法</h5><p data-id=\"p838747a-7FZNTBli\">GET</p><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-eWLoLb7b\" id=\"link-2\">请求Header</h5><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-ffLXuNFB\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-